1  | ∀x (P(x) → R(a,x))
2  | ∃x P(x)
   |----
3  | | [b]
   | |----
4  | | | a=b
   | | |----
5  | | | | [c] P(c)
   | | | |----
6  | | | | P(c) → R(a,c)            ∀ Elim: 1
7  | | | | R(a,c)                   → Elim: 6,5
8  | | | | ∃y R(a,y)                ∃ Intro: 7
9  | | | ∃y R(a,y)                  ∃ Elim: 2, 5-8
10 | | | ∃y R(b,y)                  = Elim: 9, 4
11 | | (a=b) → ∃y R(b,y)            → Intro: 4-10
12 | ∀x ((a=x) → ∃y R(x,y))         ∀ Intro: 3-11
